#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:7
msgid "Optimization Stability and Sharpness · Phenomenon reproduction"
msgstr "优化稳定性与尖锐度 · 现象复现"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:10
msgid "Edge of Stability (EOS)"
msgstr "稳定性边缘（EOS）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:13
msgid ""
"Full-batch gradient descent drives leading curvature toward $2 / \\eta$, "
"while loss continues to make non-monotonic net progress."
msgstr "全批量梯度下降会将主导曲率推向 $2 / \\eta$；尽管损失并非单调下降，整体仍会取得进展。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:22
msgid "QQ"
msgstr "清宇"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:27
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:35
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:37
msgid "**Phenomenon reproduction**"
msgstr "**现象复现**"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:42
msgid ""
"This graph demonstrates edge-of-stability dynamics with a small "
"deterministic regression problem and an exact Hessian observable. It is a"
" qualitative, mechanism-level reproduction, not a numeric match to a "
"paper figure."
msgstr ""
"本图采用小型确定性回归任务，并通过精确的 Hessian observable 展示稳定性边缘动态。"
"这是机制层面的定性复现，并非对论文图表的数值复刻。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:47
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Gradient Descent on Neural Networks Typically Occurs at the "
"Edge of Stability](https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00065), Cohen et al. (ICLR "
"2022)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [Gradient Descent on Neural Networks Typically Occurs at the "
"Edge of Stability](https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00065)，Cohen 等人（ICLR "
"2022）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:49
msgid "**Template:** `Edge of stability(EOS)`"
msgstr "**模板：** `Edge of stability(EOS)`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:51
msgid "**Template ID:** `97ff01a8-1724-43ec-8c38-fdb62bbe5faf`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `97ff01a8-1724-43ec-8c38-fdb62bbe5faf`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:53
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:55
msgid ""
"With $\\eta = 0.2$, the local linear stability boundary is $2 / \\eta = "
"10$. The intended signature is a progressive rise in the largest Hessian "
"eigenvalue, followed by fluctuations near that value and a loss curve "
"with local spikes but net decrease."
msgstr ""
"当 $\\eta = 0.2$ 时，局部线性稳定性边界为 $2 / \\eta = 10$。预期现象是最大 Hessian 特征值"
"逐步升高，随后在该值附近波动；损失曲线虽会出现局部尖峰，但整体下降。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:60
msgid "Experiment Configuration"
msgstr "实验配置"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Template setting"
msgstr "模板设置"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid ""
"Deterministic synthetic regression, 20 inputs to 1 output; 200 train and "
"50 test examples"
msgstr "确定性合成回归任务：20 维输入、1 维输出；200 个训练样本和 50 个测试样本"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Two-hidden-layer tanh MLP, width 32, seed 0"
msgstr "双隐藏层 tanh MLP，宽度为 32，seed 为 0"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Optimizer"
msgstr "优化器"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Full-batch SGD, learning rate 0.2, no momentum"
msgstr "全批量 SGD，学习率 0.2，无动量"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Training"
msgstr "训练"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Two CPU Trainers: 10,000 updates, logged every 500 updates or every update"
msgstr "两个 CPU Trainer：各运行 10,000 次更新，分别每 500 次和每次更新记录一次"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Observable"
msgstr "observable"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:39
msgid "Exact leading Hessian eigenvalue and a reference line at $2 / \\eta = 10$"
msgstr "精确计算的最大 Hessian 特征值，以及位于 $2 / \\eta = 10$ 的参考线"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:70
msgid "Run in Comfy Research"
msgstr "在 Comfy Research 中运行"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:72
msgid "Open **Templates** and load `Edge of stability(EOS)`."
msgstr "打开 **模板** 并加载 `Edge of stability(EOS)`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:73
msgid "Run the Trainer paired with the Hessian visualization."
msgstr "运行与 Hessian 可视化相连的 Trainer。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Inspect loss and $\\lambda_{\\max}$ together; use the every-update "
"Trainer to resolve individual oscillations."
msgstr "同时查看损失和 $\\lambda_{\\max}$；使用逐次更新的 Trainer 观察单次振荡。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:77
msgid ""
"Loaded Edge of Stability template with the deterministic regression "
"graph, full-batch SGD, two CPU Trainers, and Hessian observable."
msgstr "已载入稳定性边缘模板，其中包括确定性回归图、全批量 SGD、两个 CPU Trainer 和 Hessian observable。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:82
msgid "Results and Interpretation"
msgstr "结果与解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\lambda_{\\max}$ should approach the dashed threshold and remain near "
"it rather than increasing without bound. Loss can rise on individual "
"updates yet trend down over the run, which is consistent with edge-of-"
"stability behavior in this fixed, full-batch setting."
msgstr ""
"$\\lambda_{\\max}$ 应接近虚线阈值并保持在其附近，而非无限增大。损失在个别更新时可能上升，"
"但在整个训练过程中仍呈下降趋势；这与这一固定全批量设定下的稳定性边缘行为相符。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:89
msgid ""
"Completed EOS visualizations showing the leading Hessian eigenvalue near "
"the 2 over eta threshold together with the training and test loss "
"trajectories."
msgstr "完成的 EOS 可视化同时展示了接近 2 / eta 阈值的最大 Hessian 特征值，以及训练损失和测试损失轨迹。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:94
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:96
msgid "The small MSE regression task is not the paper's full experimental set."
msgstr "小型 MSE 回归任务并非论文的完整实验设置。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:97
msgid "One seed is illustrative, not a robustness study."
msgstr "单个 seed 仅作示例，并非稳健性研究。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-eos.md:98
msgid ""
"A leading eigenvalue does not establish the full self-stabilization "
"analysis."
msgstr "仅凭一个最大特征值无法完成完整的自稳定化分析。"
